{"t":"J","made":"2026-11-25 03:52","name":"Jacobs Solutions Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","employees":47000,"hq":"Dallas, TX, United States","website":"https://www.jacobs.com","summary_en":"Jacobs Solutions Inc. engages in the infrastructure and advanced facilities, and consulting businesses in the United States, Europe, Canada, India, Asia, Australia, New Zealand, the Middle East, and Africa. The company provides consulting, planning, architecture, design, engineering, and infrastructure delivery services including project, program, and construction management and long-term operation of facilities. It also offers consulting services for consumer and manufacturing, defense and security, energy and utilities, financial services, government, health and life sciences, and transport sectors. The company was founded in 1947 and is headquartered in Dallas, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Jacobs Solutions Inc.는 미국, 유럽, 캐나다, 인도, 아시아, 호주, 뉴질랜드, 중동 및 아프리카에서 인프라 및 첨단 시설, 컨설팅 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 프로젝트, 프로그램, 건설 관리 및 시설의 장기 운영을 포함한 컨설팅, 계획, 건축, 설계, 엔지니어링 및 인프라 제공 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 소비자 및 제조, 국방 및 보안, 에너지 및 유틸리티, 금융 서비스, 정부, 보건 및 생명 과학, 운송 부문에 대한 컨설팅 서비스도 제공합니다. 이 회사는 1947년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 댈러스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":152.38,"mcap":17993164800.0,"pe":50.624588,"fpe":16.168892,"peg":0.4566,"ps":1.2654119,"pb":5.467528,"ev_ebitda":20.16,"div":0.91,"beta":0.669,"hi52":162.0,"lo52":105.68},"fin":{"rev":14219215872.0,"rev_g":0.345,"eps_g":-0.254,"gross":0.22067,"op":0.05929,"net":0.0238,"roe":0.07998,"fcf":645677888.0,"cash":1179111936.0,"debt":4054662912.0,"de":124.734,"eps":3.01,"feps":9.42427},"own":{"short":0.0397,"inst":0.91043,"insider":0.0062599997},"analyst":{"n":15,"mean":169.93333,"median":175.0,"high":190.0,"low":144.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.9375,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}